for slice(r13) -> L1 else L2 stages [L1, L3, L4, L5]
// L1: free {call indirect, assign, take}
// L3: cycle Storage(r15) any_order law(Op(Add) exact commutative) {take, +, assign}
// L4: free {const_str, ref, concat, drop, assign, ref, const_str, concat, drop}
// L5: cycle Storage(r16) in_order law(Fold(r16, #2) exact) {ref, call push}
// control upfront
// cost W=58 O=18293 split when n > 10093, n = len(r13)
